      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "No. MMD models are not protected once downloaded. If the modellers didn't want their models being used in every program that can support them, then they shouldn't have released the model to begin with. All models are is a text file of vertices and texture references that is then translated by a 3D program. Modellers have no legal authority over the use of their models, doubly so if their models are of copyrighted characters. MMD Readmes hold no legal weight whatsoever.",
